--           name. See section 4.
--
-- Prerequisite: src/main/resources/db/weinvoice/V1__winv_schema.sql has been applied (schema
-- `weinvoice`; replace the schema name everywhere if the environment uses another
-- WECMS_WEINVOICE_APP_SCHEMA).
